{"ID":"20240118151118-ur1sln9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151118-ur1sln9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151118-ur1sln9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151118-68eue6x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133343-hntaqpr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133343-hntaqpr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:605,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:605\u0026#125;","title":"208栀子","type":"doc","updated":"20240201143811"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151118-68eue6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151118-68eue6x","updated":"20240122133236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治五内邪气，胃中热气，面赤，酒疱皶鼻，白癞，赤癞，疮疡。生川谷。一名木丹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133240-pklgdeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133240-pklgdeo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，我国南方及四川尤多产，实又名卮子盖象卮形也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133242-cmcgvxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133242-cmcgvxa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133243-7zxe4wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133243-7zxe4wt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】栀子为泻火要药，主五内邪气时热，心烦懊憹，泻三焦火，清胃脕血，治五种黄病，通小便，解消渴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133245-upkcr4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133245-upkcr4p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗目赤热疮，胸心大小肠大热，心中烦闷。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133247-76ni19j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133247-76ni19j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】去热毒风，除时疾热，解五种黄病，利五淋，通小便，解消渴，明目，主中恶，杀蟅虫毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133249-3wkh6sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133249-3wkh6sw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】治心烦懊憹不得眠，脐下血滞而小便不利。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133250-de87viu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133250-de87viu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】泻三焦火，清胃脕血，治热厥心痛，解热郁，行结气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133252-1td1w3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133252-1td1w3k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】栀子味苦象心包。故能泻心包之火。性苦寒，有皮膈，象心包，内之子赤，正属心之色，其花色白，当属肺金，结子成赤，当属心火，是为从肺入心，正治心中烦热之药。心为君主之官，肺为相傅之官，以制节心火之太过，栀子花白子赤，正是以肺金而归制心火也，故仲景治心中懊憹必用栀子豆豉汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133257-93qavve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133257-93qavve"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治心烦也，旁治发黄。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133258-w5icu50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133258-w5icu50"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】清胃热，泻肺火。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133259-n64c9ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133259-n64c9ly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133300-liyic32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133300-liyic32","updated":"20240201142659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡脾胃虚弱，血虚发热，心肺无邪热，小便闭由膀胱气虚，均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133336-e5msyyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133336-e5msyyw"}},{"ID":"20240122133337-9lq632o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133337-9lq632o"}},{"ID":"20240122133337-levtv0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133337-levtv0s"}},{"ID":"20240122133337-a8pn0m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133337-a8pn0m7","updated":"20240201143109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"208栀子。大家知道我们栀子花很漂亮，很香。栀子呢，它的，你看这个实，长得这样子。那这个栀子呢，是去热的药，味道很苦，非常的苦哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"味苦，性寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，药性是寒凉的，那换句话说热症我们会使用到它，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子呢，是泻火的药，泻火主要的药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那栀子张仲景用得也很多，它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主五内，五脏内部的邪热，出现热症的时候，心烦心中懊憹，三焦火很旺的时候，一般来说出现里面有热症，还有清胃皖的血，那治五种黄病，发黄，只要热症，通通可以使用栀子，所以我们用栀子去黄很有名，专门去黄的专剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那像别录呢，它说治疗眼睛红赤、热疮，所以热症都可以用。那甄权呢，他说杀这个蟅虫的毒，蟅虫是一种中药，我们后面会介绍到，五种黄病，所以发黄，小便黄，身体里面的黄，黄疸，胆堵塞到或是肝炎都会使用到。那刘元素呢，他说心烦懊憹不得眠，所以我们在热症产生的失眠的时候我们都会使用到栀子。那朱丹溪说，这个泻三焦的火，清胃热都可以。你看栀子长的样子，张仲景说了哦，我讲错了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122133343-hntaqpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133343-hntaqpr","updated":"20240201143811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐容川呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子味苦长得象心包，栀子拿起来看看，一个个象心包一样，圆圆的，红红的，所以它能泻心包的火"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，心包和三焦是表里嘛，它的性是苦寒的，还有皮膈象心包，所以我们治疗，正治心中烦热，如果你的祖母或者谁晚上睡不着，很烦那，睡不着，你就想到栀子，栀子可以除烦，吃下去人很开心就睡去了，虚热除烦。那这个心是君主之官，肺为相傅之官，来节制心火之太过，所以人身上的热我前面一再告诫诸位，心脏的热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏不断的搏动产生的热，那这个热气是往上升的，肺是相傅之官来制节它，所以肺和心两个关系很好的时候，肺就可以把心脏的热往下导，让这个热进入小肠，那如果肺的津液不够，心的热往上走的时候，心火太盛，这个时候就会懊憹啊产生心烦，这时我们可以用栀子的时候，用肺金来制心火"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，张仲景治心中懊憹用栀子豆豉汤，那过去我们栀子豆豉汤不单单是心中懊憹，还有大病，刚生完重病，所以你在治这个病人，病通通好了，哎，奇怪，这个病人现在失眠，什么都好了，就是睡觉睡不好，栀子豆豉汤，所以一般来说大病初愈之后的失眠我们也会用到栀子豆豉、豆豉汤，【药征】，它主治心烦，旁治发黄，药征讲得很简单，这个越简单的话越是正确的，因为言简纲中，几句话讲完了，所以你只要记得最主要是心烦，你只要记得心中很烦你就用栀子，旁治身体发黄，那徐【灵胎】讲得很好，专门是清胃热，能够泻肺火，肺火太盛的时候，这个肺火就来自心火，都可以使用栀子。1钱到3钱都没有关系，那栀子很苦啊，很苦。"}]}]}